Modifications in this distribution
----------------------------------

Modifications maintained by ZhangStudyLife include:

- monitoring the Codex App Server for terminal failed turn states;
- QQ notifications for final failures such as capacity, HTTP 429 and HTTP 503;
- notification-only QQ commands and reduced proactive message content;
- Windows x64 release packaging and Chinese deployment documentation.

The repository retains upstream Git history. Significant portions of the
project architecture, QQ integration, lifecycle Hooks, SQLite storage,
installation logic and runtime code originate from the upstream project and
its contributors.

